<title>Designing Product Interaction — Notes</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;background:#f8f7f4}
